{"body":{"children":[{"$ref":"#/texts/0"},{"$ref":"#/texts/1"},{"$ref":"#/texts/2"},{"$ref":"#/texts/3"},{"$ref":"#/texts/4"},{"$ref":"#/texts/5"},{"$ref":"#/texts/6"},{"$ref":"#/pictures/0"},{"$ref":"#/texts/54"},{"$ref":"#/texts/55"},{"$ref":"#/texts/56"},{"$ref":"#/texts/57"}],"content_layer":"body","label":"unspecified","name":"_root_","self_ref":"#/body"},"form_items":[],"furniture":{"children":[],"content_layer":"furniture","label":"unspecified","name":"_root_","self_ref":"#/furniture"},"groups":[],"key_value_items":[],"name":"00922ce2b476b7fd200a009b191af89c84f6_page_2_pg1","origin":{"binary_hash":11244520901377687032,"filename":"00922ce2b476b7fd200a009b191af89c84f6_page_2_pg1.pdf","mimetype":"application/pdf"},"pages":{"1":{"page_no":1,"size":{"height":799.3699951171875,"width":595.2760009765625}}},"pictures":[{"annotations":[],"captions":[],"children":[{"$ref":"#/texts/7"},{"$ref":"#/texts/8"},{"$ref":"#/texts/9"},{"$ref":"#/texts/10"},{"$ref":"#/texts/11"},{"$ref":"#/texts/12"},{"$ref":"#/texts/13"},{"$ref":"#/texts/14"},{"$ref":"#/texts/15"},{"$ref":"#/texts/16"},{"$ref":"#/texts/17"},{"$ref":"#/texts/18"},{"$ref":"#/texts/19"},{"$ref":"#/texts/20"},{"$ref":"#/texts/21"},{"$ref":"#/texts/22"},{"$ref":"#/texts/23"},{"$ref":"#/texts/24"},{"$ref":"#/texts/25"},{"$ref":"#/texts/26"},{"$ref":"#/texts/27"},{"$ref":"#/texts/28"},{"$ref":"#/texts/29"},{"$ref":"#/texts/30"},{"$ref":"#/texts/31"},{"$ref":"#/texts/32"},{"$ref":"#/texts/33"},{"$ref":"#/texts/34"},{"$ref":"#/texts/35"},{"$ref":"#/texts/36"},{"$ref":"#/texts/37"},{"$ref":"#/texts/38"},{"$ref":"#/texts/39"},{"$ref":"#/texts/40"},{"$ref":"#/texts/41"},{"$ref":"#/texts/42"},{"$ref":"#/texts/43"},{"$ref":"#/texts/44"},{"$ref":"#/texts/45"},{"$ref":"#/texts/46"},{"$ref":"#/texts/47"},{"$ref":"#/texts/48"},{"$ref":"#/texts/49"},{"$ref":"#/texts/50"},{"$ref":"#/texts/51"},{"$ref":"#/texts/52"},{"$ref":"#/texts/53"}],"content_layer":"body","footnotes":[],"label":"picture","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":83.78717041015625,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":117.45138549804688,"r":558.708251953125,"t":485.56744384765625},"charspan":[0,0],"page_no":1}],"references":[],"self_ref":"#/pictures/0"}],"schema_name":"DoclingDocument","tables":[],"texts":[{"children":[],"content_layer":"furniture","label":"page_header","orig":"Articles","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":749.4718967931651,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":51.0236,"r":87.4436,"t":759.6175951171874},"charspan":[0,8],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/0","text":"Articles"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Methods","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":661.6737716535004,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":119.054,"r":158.77499999999998,"t":670.9739951171874},"charspan":[0,7],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/1","text":"Methods"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Study design and participants","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":650.9759839440031,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":119.054,"r":233.41500000000002,"t":659.0079951171875},"charspan":[0,29],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/2","text":"Study design and participants"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"We did this three parallel group, randomised controlled trial in Auckland, New Zealand. First randomisation was on Sept 6, 2011, and last follow-up was on July 5, 2013. The published protocol describes procedures in detail. 13 In brief, people were eligible if they were aged 18 years or older, had smoked ten or more cigarettes per day for the past year, wanted to stop smoking, and could provide consent. We  recruited via community  newspapers, inviting  people  to  call  the  study  centre  for  eligibility prescreening,  done  by  research  assistants,  who  also completed follow-up assessments. We excluded pregnant and breastfeeding women; people using cessation drugs or in an existing cessation programme; those reporting heart  attack,  stroke,  or  severe  angina  in  the  previous","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":496.9083831966573,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":119.04999999999998,"r":335.3181999999999,"t":648.1089951171875},"charspan":[0,796],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/3","text":"We did this three parallel group, randomised controlled trial in Auckland, New Zealand. First randomisation was on Sept 6, 2011, and last follow-up was on July 5, 2013. The published protocol describes procedures in detail. 13 In brief, people were eligible if they were aged 18 years or older, had smoked ten or more cigarettes per day for the past year, wanted to stop smoking, and could provide consent. We  recruited via community  newspapers, inviting  people  to  call  the  study  centre  for  eligibility prescreening,  done  by  research  assistants,  who  also completed follow-up assessments. We excluded pregnant and breastfeeding women; people using cessation drugs or in an existing cessation programme; those reporting heart  attack,  stroke,  or  severe  angina  in  the  previous"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"2 weeks; and those with poorly controlled medical disorders, allergies, or other chemical depen  dence. Participants were mailed study information, and consent forms to  sign  and  return.  The  Northern  X  Regional  Ethics Committee approved the study (Number NTX/10/11/111); the Standing Committee on Therapeutic Trials approved the  use  of  nicotine  e-cigarettes  because  they  were  not permitted for sale in New Zealand, but could be imported for personal use or research.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":573.9213831966568,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":344.40099999999995,"r":560.6674000000005,"t":670.1259951171871},"charspan":[0,481],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/4","text":"2 weeks; and those with poorly controlled medical disorders, allergies, or other chemical depen  dence. Participants were mailed study information, and consent forms to  sign  and  return.  The  Northern  X  Regional  Ethics Committee approved the study (Number NTX/10/11/111); the Standing Committee on Therapeutic Trials approved the  use  of  nicotine  e-cigarettes  because  they  were  not permitted for sale in New Zealand, but could be imported for personal use or research."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Randomisation and masking","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":551.9759839440031,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":344.408,"r":454.361,"t":560.0079951171875},"charspan":[0,25],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/5","text":"Randomisation and masking"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Callers  who  met  the  inclusion  criteria  and  gave  demographic  details  and  information  about  nicotine  dependence (Fagerström test for nicotine dependence [FTND] 14 ) were  randomised  by  the  study  statistician  (VP)  in  a 4:4:1  ratio  to  nicotine  e-cigarettes,  patches,  or  placebo","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":496.8923831966577,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":344.40409999999997,"r":560.6741,"t":549.1089951171875},"charspan":[0,301],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/6","text":"Callers  who  met  the  inclusion  criteria  and  gave  demographic  details  and  information  about  nicotine  dependence (Fagerström test for nicotine dependence [FTND] 14 ) were  randomised  by  the  study  statistician  (VP)  in  a 4:4:1  ratio  to  nicotine  e-cigarettes,  patches,  or  placebo"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"289 assigned to nicotine e-cigarettes","parent":{"$ref":"#/pictures/0"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":392.0452357596456,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":129.9183,"r":221.63979999999995,"t":397.7292951171875},"charspan":[0,37],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/7","text":"289 assigned to nicotine e-cigarettes"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text",